    "body": "## Why\r\n\r\n`test_fs_tiering_offloading` sometimes fails with AssertionError: No CPU stored events received. MockSubscriber.get_new_cpu_stored_events() only polls for 1s, then returns empty instead of waiting for the drain deadline. With a real fs tier, disk I/O can delay the CPU BlockStored event past 1s, causing flakiness. Test-only issue, not OffloadingConnector.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\nKeep polling until _EVENT_DRAIN_TIMEOUT if no CPU stored event has been seen. After one arrives, return on the next idle poll.  \r\n",
